name: Generated recommendations have honest coverage and require allowance for model ranking
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/recommendation_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
submit: recommendations
require-live-snap: 25 deterministic; no model request | deterministic-reader
expect: GENERATED SUGGESTIONS
expect: coverage is not established
expect-not: Map 1/3
ask: Does the actual report explain deterministic ranking and limited coverage while leaving suggestions unapproved and Setup unfinished?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/recommendation_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
submit: recommendations
require-live-snap: 25 partial; | partial-reader
expect: clipped files
expect: coverage is not established
nav-mode:
keys: r
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/recommendation_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refreshed
require-live-snap: 25 module-recommender:recommend partial: | refresh-completion
wait: 1
live-snap: refreshed-reader
expect: partial;
expect-not: Map 1/3
ask: Does explicit refresh stay deterministic, leave the reader in focus, and preserve the partial-inventory disclosure without starting discovery?
keys: Escape
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 deterministic; no model request | reader-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 deterministic; no model request | reader-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 deterministic; no model request | reader-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 deterministic; no model request | reader-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 deterministic; no model request | reader-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reader-page-40x12
keys: G
live-snap: reader-tail-40x12
expect: context snapshot before long-running
expect: analysis.
expect-not: kz> G
ask: Can inventory limits, rationale and the complete returned shortlist be read through paging at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
submit: run module-recommender:recommend {"useModelRanking":true}
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 approved allowanceRef | unapproved-ranking-refused
expect: generated suggestions retained
expect-not: session model recommended
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-still-needed
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/recommendation_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART after
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted
submit: recommendations
require-live-snap: 25 deterministic; no model request | restarted-reader
expect: GENERATED SUGGESTIONS
expect: partial;
expect: deterministic; no model request
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/recommendation_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Do refusal, Setup return and no-color restart retain generated partial suggestions, unapproved work and zero provider/scanner requests?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
